---
source: tests/golden/notifications.rs
expression: "norm::text(&out)"
---
provider: sendgrid (SendGrid)

## minimal config
{
  "api_key": "SG.",
  "from": "alerts@example.com",
  "to": "ops@example.com"
}

### down
POST https://api.sendgrid.com/v3/mail/send
Authorization: Bearer SG.
(json)
{
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "text/plain",
      "value": "Payments API is down\nHTTP 503 (after 3 retries)\nTarget: https://pay.example/health\nType: HTTP(S)\nTime: 2026-10-19 14:03:12 UTC\nhttps://vv.example/monitors/7"
    }
  ],
  "from": {
    "email": "alerts@example.com"
  },
  "personalizations": [
    {
      "to": [
        {
          "email": "ops@example.com"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "subject": "🔴 Payments API is down"
}

### up
POST https://api.sendgrid.com/v3/mail/send
Authorization: Bearer SG.
(json)
{
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "text/plain",
      "value": "Payments API is back up\ndown for 12m 4s\nTarget: https://pay.example/health\nType: HTTP(S)\nDowntime: 12m 4s\nTime: 2026-10-19 14:03:12 UTC\nhttps://vv.example/monitors/7"
    }
  ],
  "from": {
    "email": "alerts@example.com"
  },
  "personalizations": [
    {
      "to": [
        {
          "email": "ops@example.com"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "subject": "🟢 Payments API is back up"
}

